    Eliminate managed services part 2 (#8158)
    
    Follow up on #8010 which left quite a few ManagedService implementations
    in the code.
    
    Replaces ManagedService with declarative service in most of the
    remaining classes. Only does the replacement for relatively easy cases.
    Classes with ManagedServiceFactories or special cases like
    ConfigureableLoginHandler were intentionally left alone.
    
    Might allow us to close
    https://github.com/opencast/opencast/issues/1174, since the properties
    object cannot be null when using declarative services.
    
    ### How to test this patch
    
    Ideally test if the services still properly load their configuration. I
    only did this randomly for a few cases.
    
